{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Keystone Library</i>, a growing collection of story-driven games where every book offers a unique adventure. From epic fantasy to gritty cyberpunk, each story is brought to life with handcrafted illustrations, custom-composed music, and immersive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover RPG quests, tactical battles, puzzles, and character progression, all controlled through an intuitive keyword-based interface. Whether you're solving mysteries, embarking on daring quests, or exploring strange new worlds, <i>Keystone Library</i> offers something for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for readers, writers, artists, and gamers who love rich stories and creative expression, the library continues to expand. With each update, new books introduce fresh stories, environments, and challenges, making every chapter a new journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently in Early Access, <i>Keystone Library</i> will remain a work in progress until at least three complete books are available. Join us now to explore the first stories, share your feedback, and help shape the library\u2019s future.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2183340?t=1769508821","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183340/10251f7dee635d03fbd3a540fb3263f971f45c31/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769508821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183340/d83df2c6026b738f21690eb40f42ec48fe817751/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769508821","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183340/d83df2c6026b738f21690eb40f42ec48fe817751/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769508821","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Early Beta Access</h1><p>We are in Early Beta. But the game seems stable thus far. Feel free to try the game now and let us know of any problems or oddities.<br><br>More content coming soon!</p><br><h1>Major Update</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183340/extras/e6c3c15bfce4e94852219dd9301a13fd.avif?t=1769508821\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183340/extras_big/e6c3c15bfce4e94852219dd9301a13fd.webp?t=1769508821 width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The library has received its largest visual update since Early Access began.<br>This overhaul brings the world closer to the final vision and makes the entire experience feel richer and more immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuilt <strong>library interior</strong> with new illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New chapter games, mini-games and activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated <strong>Artwork</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaner interface, layout, improved readability, and atmosphere upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of refined visuals across the early chapters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More updates and new content are in active development \u2014 thank you for your patience and support.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Keystone Library</i>, a growing collection of story-driven games where every book offers a unique adventure. From epic fantasy to gritty cyberpunk, each story is brought to life with handcrafted illustrations, custom-composed music, and immersive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover RPG quests, tactical battles, puzzles, and character progression, all controlled through an intuitive keyword-based interface. Whether you're solving mysteries, embarking on daring quests, or exploring strange new worlds, <i>Keystone Library</i> offers something for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for readers, writers, artists, and gamers who love rich stories and creative expression, the library continues to expand. With each update, new books introduce fresh stories, environments, and challenges, making every chapter a new journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently in Early Access, <i>Keystone Library</i> will remain a work in progress until at least three complete books are available. Join us now to explore the first stories, share your feedback, and help shape the library\u2019s future.</p>","developers":["Dream Gears"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183340/071e6308f470d87b20508c64aa2ba6fc62dda223/header.jpg?t=1769508821","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> LTS Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8 Ghz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeoForce GTX 590</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 - 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2+ GHz Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeoForce GTX 1660 or better</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2183340/1008897900/ae792f11df